{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01等没有标注分时出现的感受词较密，视觉扫读压力高于Y，部分细节也容易互相争夺注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息更密，但关键词加亮让观众能迅速抓住每段心理变化的核心，话与感受交替、感受按音乐时点出现，也让情绪变化有了清楚的推进过程。尤其从害怕被嫌弃、逐渐放松，到舍不得、担忧失去，再到接受不确定性，X把这些心理转折与音乐细节结合得更紧。Y的双栏布局更容易快速扫读，但右侧感受较像并列的描述集合，与人物每一步心理变化的对应关系不如X鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d4ab6089-22b1-4c43-9fa5-064963d328de", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010153164713Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:03:34.223213+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "28a4e62f58b8b01e8e721388b3b3ad3b7c08f7c313131b3251c7371c93364062", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments